cmu-weyuexec-name-sitedirector = WY Director
cmu-weyuexec-description-sitedirector = A member of the Weyland-Yutani Directorate, on the ground in person. Whatever happened here, the company line is that it is now under control. It is your job to make that true.
cmu-weyuexec-name-chiefexecutive = WY Chief Executive
cmu-weyuexec-description-chiefexecutive = The sector chief. Every company site in the sector answers to you, and you answer to the Directorate. You're here to protect the company's interests and, failing that, its reputation.
cmu-weyuexec-name-divisionmanager = WY Division Manager
cmu-weyuexec-description-divisionmanager = The manager who runs this site. Get it back under control, trim the dead weight, and file everything deniably.
cmu-weyuexec-name-legalsupervisor = WY Legal Supervisor
cmu-weyuexec-description-legalsupervisor = The company's legal presence on-site. Every liability gets documented, every witness gets a form, and nothing said near you is off the record.
cmu-weyuexec-name-legalspecialist = WY Legal Specialist
cmu-weyuexec-description-legalspecialist = Junior legal staff attached to the executive detail. You carry the paperwork so nobody else has to admit it exists.
cmu-weyuexec-prefix-sitedirector = DIR
cmu-weyuexec-prefix-chiefexecutive = CEX
cmu-weyuexec-prefix-divisionmanager = DVM
cmu-weyuexec-prefix-legalsupervisor = LSV
cmu-weyuexec-prefix-legalspecialist = LSP
cmu-weyuexec-name-goon = WY Personal Protection Officer
cmu-weyuexec-description-goon = Weyland-Yutani Personal Protection. Close protection for the Company personnel you're assigned to, whether executives, auditors or whoever head office sends. Keep your principals alive. Everyone else can wait.
cmu-weyuexec-name-goonleader = WY Personal Protection Coordinator
cmu-weyuexec-description-goonleader = Lead a Weyland-Yutani Personal Protection detail. Plan routes, assign your officers and decide when to pull your principals out.
cmu-weyuexec-name-lawyer = WY Corporate Lawyer
cmu-weyuexec-description-lawyer = Company counsel attached to the executive detail. Nothing is your fault, everything is billable, and every conversation is being recorded.
cmu-weyuexec-prefix-goon = PPO.
cmu-weyuexec-prefix-goonleader = PPC.
cmu-weyuexec-name-protection-specialist = WY Personal Protection Specialist
cmu-weyuexec-description-protection-specialist = The heavy hitter of a Weyland-Yutani Personal Protection detail. You carry the detail's SMG; use it only when your principals are in real danger.
cmu-weyuexec-prefix-protection-specialist = PPS.
cmu-weyuexec-prefix-lawyer = LAW
cmu-weyuexec-greeting-security = You are Weyland-Yutani Personal Protection, escorting Company personnel through a very bad day. Keep your principals alive, protect Company personnel and assets, and use the minimum force that keeps the denial plausible.
cmu-weyuexec-supervisors-hq = The Weyland-Yutani Directorate
cmu-weyuexec-supervisors-director = The Director
cmu-weyuexec-supervisors-chiefexecutive = The Chief Executive
cmu-weyuexec-supervisors-protection = Your principals and the Personal Protection Coordinator
cmu-weyuexec-supervisors-protection-coordinator = Your principals
cmu-weyuexec-greeting = You are part of a Weyland-Yutani executive detail sent to inspect the site. Protect the company's interests, its assets, and above all its secrets. What happened here stays off the record.
cmu-weyuexec-rules = You are a Weyland-Yutani executive. You are a normal human who can be killed by any threat. Protect company assets and personnel, deny everything, and avoid open combat where paperwork will do.

## Directorate Protection (admin-only)
cmu-directorate-protection-supervisors-directorate = The visiting Directorate member
cmu-directorate-protection-supervisors-coordinator = The Directorate Protection Coordinator
cmu-directorate-protection-greeting = You are part of a Directorate Protection detail. Your principal is a member of the Weyland-Yutani Directorate. Keep them alive and keep the visit on schedule.
cmu-directorate-protection-rules = You are a Directorate Protection operative. Protect your principal, follow your Coordinator and do not start fights the visit doesn't need.

cmu-directorate-protection-name-officer = WY Directorate Protection Officer
cmu-directorate-protection-description-officer = Close protection for a visiting member of the Weyland-Yutani Directorate.
cmu-directorate-protection-prefix-officer = DPO.

cmu-directorate-protection-name-specialist = WY Directorate Protection Specialist
cmu-directorate-protection-description-specialist = Senior close protection for a visiting member of the Weyland-Yutani Directorate.
cmu-directorate-protection-prefix-specialist = DPS.

cmu-directorate-protection-name-coordinator = WY Directorate Protection Coordinator
cmu-directorate-protection-description-coordinator = Lead the protection detail for a visiting member of the Weyland-Yutani Directorate.
cmu-directorate-protection-prefix-coordinator = DPC.
